Today is Wednesday.
I wake up in the morning.
I open the door.
I step out onto the small balcony.
I raise my hands upwards.
I look at the sky.
The sun shines brightly.
There is strong sunlight now.
The summer in Kochi is starting.
It is very hot today.
There is no wind at all outside.
I am sweating.
This is a heavy summer.
I walk back to the room.
I drink a glass of water.
